REPLACE THIS FILE.

This is a placeholder, not a real Porcupine wake word model.

1. Go to https://console.picovoice.ai and sign up (free).
2. Train a custom wake word "hey backbrain" for your target platform (Android/iOS).
3. Download the real .ppn file it gives you.
4. Replace this file with that one, keeping the same filename: hey_backbrain.ppn

The app will not detect the wake word correctly until you do this —
a real .ppn is a trained binary model, not something that can be
generated without the Picovoice Console.
